  "description": "\"Numb/Encore\" is a song by American rapper Jay-Z and rock band Linkin Park from their EP Collision Course (2004). It was released as a single on December 13, 2004, by Warner Bros., Machine Shop, Def Jam, and Roc-A-Fella Records. The song is a mash-up that fuses rock and hip hop, combining lyrics from \"Numb\" by Linkin Park and \"Encore\" by Jay-Z, both released in 2003.",
